SUMMARY:EMEA Next Generation CFO Academy - Virtual Close
CATEGORIES:Personal
DESCRIPTION:Caution: This email originated from outside of the organization
 . Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender a
 nd know the content is safe.\n\nDear all\,\n\nIn our virtual roundtable we
  will reflect on your time at the EMEA Next Generation CFO Academy\, and h
 ow you will use what you have learned as you continue in your career journ
 ey.\n\nWe will be joined by Alison Baker\, AC Chair at Endeavour Mining pl
 c and Helios Towers plc.\n\nPlease join us for this roundtable\, so we can
  come together as group once more\, reconnect you with peers and provide f
 urther perspectives from senior executives and global leading experts!\n\n
 If you have any questions\, please do let us know.\n\nWe look forward to r
 econnecting\,\n\nKind regards\,\n\nDavid Anderson\, Sabine Benz\, and Rich
 ard Muschamp\nEMEA Next Generation CFO Academy\n\nThis message (including 
 any attachments) contains confidential information intended for a specific
  individual and purpose\, and is protected by law. If you are not the inte
 nded recipient\, you should delete this message and any disclosure\, copyi
 ng\, or distribution of this message\, or the taking of any action based o
 n it\, by you is strictly prohibited.\n\nDeloitte refers to a Deloitte mem
 ber firm\, one of its related entities\, or Deloitte Touche Tohmatsu Limit
 ed ("DTTL"). Each Deloitte member firm is a separate legal entity and a me
 mber of DTTL. DTTL does not provide services to clients. Please see www.de
 loitte.com/about (http://www.deloitte.com/about) to learn more.\nv.E.1
END:VEVENT
